      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Trout Creek is officially the Huckleberry Capital of Montana, a title that carries more than ceremony.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://roamingmontana.com/trout-creek/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Old Jail Museum in Trout Creek showcases the region’s history and the lives of its early residents.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
